# Apply order for the orca-server patch series (quilt `series` format).
#
# Order is DATA, not a filename convention — a patch's name says what capability
# it adds, never where it sits. Reordering is an edit to this file and nothing
# else; there is no such operation as "renumbering".
#
# `quilt push -a` applies these top to bottom onto the pinned lib/orca submodule.
# The Dockerfile consumes the patched tree; it applies nothing itself.

